vetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 장소: IDEC 동탄교육장 (롯데백화점 동탄점 내)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 대상:&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-weight: bolder;\">반도체 분야 취업을 희망하는 학부 졸업(예정)자인 분 (전공자, 비전공자 모두 포함)</span></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 수강 혜택</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 1) 교육비 전액 지원</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 2) 교육지원금 지급 (요건 충족 시)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 3) 협력 기업 소개 및 취업 기회 제공</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">○ 신청 기간: 2025. 6. 30.(월) ~ 7. 11.(금)</span></b></span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 신청 방법: 온라인 신청 (</span></font><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">https://academy.idec.or.kr/)</span></font></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
